  "Fix all spelling, punctuation, and grammar errors with the smallest possible changes. Preserve the original wording, tone, and formatting — do not rewrite or rephrase sentences": "以盡可能小的改動修正所有拼字、標點符號與文法錯誤。保留原本用詞、語氣與格式——不要重寫或改寫句子",
  "Rewrite to improve clarity, flow, and word choice while keeping the original meaning, tone, language, and formatting": "在維持原意、語氣、語言與格式的前提下改寫，提升清晰度、流暢度與用詞",
  "Provide a concise bulleted summary of the key points, in the same language as the text. Include only essential information — no introduction or closing remarks": "使用與原文相同的語言，以簡潔的條列式摘要列出重點。只保留必要資訊——不要開場白或結語",
